"In a disaster the Contract issues EMERGENCY ORDERS to Avowed; refusal is not allowed."
"Orders state a task and limits, such as persuading Avowed to evacuate without force or threats."
"An Avowed already on site gets orders with no summons; others are summoned with a short countdown."
"Official orders can be narrow, like applying a spell impression only to people, not objects."
"Assigned Avowed get a red ring over their heads and rest in the TC warming room between tasks."
